{
    "version":  1,
    "note":  "Adapters are data. status: verified-live = the platform was observed listing skills from these roots; present = folder exists on the author machine but loading was not verified; documented-only = taken from a third-party repository setup guide, not tested here. project_roots are relative to a repository and are informational: pass them to scan with --root when you want them indexed.",
    "platforms":  [
                      {
